    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0275",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1988022626,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1988022626,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40.0,
      "y": 544.0,
      "width": 709.8,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "The orange one is the pass that removed the loop, and it is the only one with nothing to\nshow you. opt prints the IR after a pass by asking the loop it just ran on to print itself,\nand by then there was no loop. It writes one line instead and no IR at all.",
      "originalText": "The orange one is the pass that removed the loop, and it is the only one with nothing to\nshow you. opt prints the IR after a pass by asking the loop it just ran on to print itself,\nand by then there was no loop. It writes one line instead and no IR at all.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0276",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1530446683,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1530446683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "note2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40.0,
      "y": 610.0,
      "width": 686.4,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "Look at the pass before it. IndVarSimplify made the function five lines longer, which is\nthe opposite of what an optimiser is supposed to do, and it is what made the deletion\npossible. Getting shorter is not the same thing as making progress.",
      "originalText": "Look at the pass before it. IndVarSimplify made the function five lines longer, which is\nthe opposite of what an optimiser is supposed to do, and it is what made the deletion\npossible. Getting shorter is not the same thing as making progress.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0277",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1668993320,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1668993320,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "note3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40.0,
      "y": 676.0,
      "width": 702.0,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "The grey ticks are not wasted work either. Most of them are a pass looking for a pattern\nthat is not in this function, and the same pipeline has to be right for five lines and for\nfive thousand. Take the loop out and it drops to 108 passes with 7 changes.",
      "originalText": "The grey ticks are not wasted work either. Most of them are a pass looking for a pattern\nthat is not in this function, and the same pipeline has to be right for five lines and for\nfive thousand. Take the loop out and it drops to 108 passes with 7 changes.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0278",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1708562544,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1708562544,
